views.usage.body=decompose  writes every .san of a building variant folder (with its _h.dds)\n           to <out-dir>: a PNG per sprite, all on one canvas with the zero cross\n           at the same pixel, a JSON of every pack field per .san, and\n           building.json (canvas, anchor, passability, origin).\ncamera     solves the 2003 camera from the picture and world point pairs of the\n           variants' 1.xml and fits a box over each footprint to the sprite's\n           outline. --out writes the result as JSON.
