sprite.usage.compose_pack=compose-pack  packs a building, object or fence picture as the Resource\n              Editor's export does: <out-name>.san with _c/_l/_h.dds, and its\n              shadow as <out-name>s.san. --zero is the zero cross in the picture,\n              --noise a damage state's ground picture (<out-name>g.san), --pass\n              the passability rows of 1.xml and --locked the grid origin on\n              screen, relative to the zero cross.
